We both clear the plates from the table together.
Priya goes into the kitchen.
She brings the Kaju Katli on a plate.
She smiles and says, "Let's eat the sweets now."
I say happily, "Yes, absolutely."
Priya says, "I will also bring tea for us both."
She comes back with two cups of hot tea.
We sit comfortably on the sofa.
We drink the hot tea and eat the sweets.
The Kaju Katli is very delicious.
We do not talk about the office anymore.
We just talk like friends.
I think to myself.
I feel that I am finally building a family of my own in Mumbai.
I think that I will make very good friends here.
I am no longer alone in this big city.
This evening is very special to me.
